# The build context is 07-simulation-environments: only what the Dockerfile copies goes in, so rollouts, venvs, viewer
# assets and runs/ stay out, and so do the wind and lines weeks, which are mounted to serve portsim-wind and
# portsim-lines (rollout.py stages its own build context).
*
!portsim-v1/envs/berth_planning/core
!portsim-v1/envs/berth_planning/tasks/dock-v1-eval
!portsim-v1/envs/berth_planning/tasks/dock-v1-train
!portsim-live/envs/port_week/core
!portsim-live/envs/port_week/agentenv/pyproject.toml
!portsim-live/envs/port_week/agentenv/port_week_agentenv
!portsim-live/envs/port_week/tasks
portsim-live/envs/port_week/tasks/wind
portsim-live/envs/port_week/tasks/dock-v1-wind
portsim-live/envs/port_week/tasks/lines
portsim-live/envs/port_week/tasks/dock-v1-lines
**/tests
**/.venv
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
